  unlockedIntroText: Welcome Master! Asmo will make even your companion fall head
    over heels!
  lockedIntroText: Welcome! Who did you come with today?
  unlockedSoloIntroText: Welcome Master! Since you came alone that means Asmo gets
    you all to herself right?
  lockedSoloIntroText: Welcome! Did you come alone today?
  soloMonologueText: A guest who comes alone looks more refined. Probably.
  unlockedPityGiftText: Master came alone so Asmo will give you exclusive care! Here
    is a special gift!
  lockedPityGiftText: Not because you looked lonely or anything! It is just a special
    service!
  soloFarewellText: I came in alone and I leave alone. Well protagonists are usually
    alone anyway.
  guestPairText: All right! I will help you with the pair course!
  operatorSelectedText: With Asmo? Oh wow... Master that is so unfair!
  defaultSupporterSelectedText: Enjoyed the Maid Cafe together.
  defaultGiftText: Received a gift.
  defaultMaxSkillGiftText: The supporter's skill has been enhanced to the maximum.
    Obtained an additional gift instead.
  unlockedFinishText: You fell head over heels for Asmo's charm right? Please come
    see me again next time!
  lockedFinishText: Did you have a good time? Please visit us again!
  noGiftAvailableText: There are no gifts available to receive.
